## Measurements (decided 2026-10-22, design canvas "Measurements – display and export")

Built: measurement steps (category Measure, after Object), `MeasurementInfo` (cfg), `PipelineMeasurements` + `cache.add_image_measurement` / `add_object_measurement`, a name per step (`#[cmdsmeta(measurement_name = "…")]`, unique in the project, filled as `pearson_01`, checked), the `measurements` table (one row per value, readable without a join) + `measurement_info` (the pickers' list), images without objects measured too. First step: Pearson Correlation (whole image).

Decided - to build, in this order:
- [x] Results (2026-10-22): `Column::Measurement(MeasurementColumn)` (key, step, name, per object or per image), listed under "Measurements" from `measurement_info` (`get_measurement_columns`; none in older results). Object list: each object's own value / its image plane's (one extra query per page). Per image, plate, well: an image measurement is the image's own value (`imm` / `plate_image_measurement_sql`: each image once, also without objects - not weighted by objects); an object measurement is aggregated over objects like Area. Charts: object measurements. GUI resolves picker keys via the open results' columns (`column_for_key`). Remote protocol 25 -> 26.
